      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah my suggestion for that was a double click on the settings tab. But since the expand button does the same thing as the Worlds Quick Link, it would also make sense to just replace it.\nMy canny about the double click action:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-dubble-click-function-to-open-main-menu-settings\nEdit: I could imagine that opening some sort of dashbord in the new Main Menu as soon as that get's updated.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-11-12T19:40:27.209Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, there is no quick link to the settings menu in the launch pad. The quickest way to access settings is by going to the settings tab and clicking the \"expand\" button in the corner.\nI propose either adding a gear icon to the launch pad that opens up settings, or replacing the expand button in the launch pad with a settings button, seeing as the current expand button just launches the worlds menu. Which is something that the worlds quick link already does.",
